", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "_data": [], "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn8le04ob05re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn8le04ob05re2img01.jpg "}, {"time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Paulo! Great to see you! How are things?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Paulo</span>: Good. Hey ... would you do me a favor?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: It would be my pleasure.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Paulo</span>: Would you mind getting us a drink? I enjoy drinking and chatting.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: No worries. You deserve to drink something cold in this hot weather. Could I get us beers?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Paulo</span>: Sure.  So, I didn't expect to see you in Brazil so soon. Did you happen to come here for business or pleasure?", "id": 1, "image": "engenn8le04ob05re2img01.jpg "}, {"time": "25000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: When I travel abroad, I manage to mix business with pleasure. This time I regret to inform you that it is urgent business. Could I ask you to help me with something? What's your schedule like these days?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Paulo</span>: Busy! But you know me! Never able to mind my own business... I'd be happy to help you.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: I need someone to investigate the business practices of a clothing company - Holly's. Can you do that for me?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Paulo</span>: Absolutely.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn8le04ob05re2img05.jpg "}, {"time": "54000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Would you consider doing me a huge favor? I need you to look up Farmani. He's the owner and appears to be closely connected to this.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Paulo</span>: What's your connection?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Polygon - the company I work for - was hired to promote their business. The rumor is that Farmani's agreed to outsource his labor and it relies on employing child labor.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Paulo</span>: Wow. What are the details?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Only a rumor. I'm asking you to get to the truth. Would it be too much trouble for you to get some background on Farmani's business' practices in other areas?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Paulo</span>: For sure. I'll work on getting to the bottom of this.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn8le04ob05re2img06.jpg "}], "coverimg": "engenn8le04ob05re2img01.jpg "}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "id": 1}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0}]}